#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Code Assistant {#qiskit-code-assistant}"
msgstr "Qiskit Code Assistant {#qiskit-code-assistant}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit Code Assistant LLMs aim to make quantum computing more accessible to "
"new Qiskit adopters and to improve the coding experience for current users. "
"It is trained using millions of text tokens from Qiskit SDK, years of Qiskit"
" code examples, and IBM Quantum&reg; features. Qiskit Code Assistant can "
"help your quantum development workflow by offering LLM-generated suggestions"
" based on [IBM Granite and other open-source "
"models](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit), which incorporate the latest "
"features and functionalities from IBM&reg;.\n"
msgstr ""
"LLM Qiskit Code Assistant bertujuan untuk menjadikan pengkomputeran kuantum "
"lebih mudah diakses oleh pengguna Qiskit baharu dan meningkatkan pengalaman "
"pengekodan bagi pengguna semasa. Ia dilatih menggunakan jutaan token teks "
"dari Qiskit SDK, bertahun-tahun contoh kod Qiskit, dan ciri IBM "
"Quantum&reg;. Qiskit Code Assistant boleh membantu aliran kerja pembangunan "
"kuantum anda dengan menawarkan cadangan yang dijana oleh LLM berdasarkan "
"[model IBM Granite dan model sumber terbuka "
"lain](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit), yang menggabungkan ciri dan fungsi "
"terkini dari IBM&reg;.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"- **Want to skip to the installation instructions? Go to the [Install Qiskit Code Assistant](#install) section.**\n"
"- If you have feedback or want to contact the developer team, use the [Qiskit Slack Workspace channel](https://qiskit.enterprise.slack.com/archives/C07LYA6PL83) or the related public GitHub repositories.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Nota\">\n"
"- **Ingin terus ke arahan pemasangan? Pergi ke bahagian [Pasang Qiskit Code Assistant](#install).**\n"
"- Jika anda ada maklum balas atau ingin menghubungi pasukan pembangun, gunakan [saluran Qiskit Slack Workspace](https://qiskit.enterprise.slack.com/archives/C07LYA6PL83) atau repositori GitHub awam yang berkaitan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Large Language Model (LLM) behind Qiskit Code Assistant {#the-large-"
"language-model-llm-behind-qiskit-code-assistant}"
msgstr ""
"Model Bahasa Besar (LLM) di sebalik Qiskit Code Assistant {#the-large-"
"language-model-llm-behind-qiskit-code-assistant}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To provide code suggestions, Qiskit Code Assistant uses a Large Language "
"Model (LLM). In this case, Qiskit Code Assistant currently relies on the "
"model `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit`, built on the [Mistral-"
"Small-3.2-24B-Qiskit model](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/mistral-"
"small-3.2-24b-qiskit). The `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` model improves the"
" `Mistral-Small-3.2-24B-Instruct-2506` model's code generation capabilities "
"for Qiskit through extended pretraining and fine-tuning it on high-quality "
"Qiskit data, as well as Python commits and chat. For more information about "
"the Mistral AI models family, refer to [Mistral AI "
"documentation](https://docs.mistral.ai/getting-started/models). For more "
"details about the `.*-qiskit` models, see [Qiskit Code Assistant: Training "
"LLMs for generating Quantum Computing "
"Code](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.19495).\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk memberikan cadangan kod, Qiskit Code Assistant menggunakan Model "
"Bahasa Besar (LLM). Dalam kes ini, Qiskit Code Assistant kini bergantung "
"pada model `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit`, yang dibina atas [model Mistral-"
"Small-3.2-24B-Qiskit](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/mistral-"
"small-3.2-24b-qiskit). Model `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` meningkatkan "
"keupayaan penjanaan kod model `Mistral-Small-3.2-24B-Instruct-2506` untuk "
"Qiskit melalui pra-latihan lanjutan dan penalaan halus pada data Qiskit "
"berkualiti tinggi, serta komit Python dan chat. Untuk maklumat lanjut "
"tentang keluarga model Mistral AI, rujuk [dokumentasi Mistral "
"AI](https://docs.mistral.ai/getting-started/models). Untuk maklumat lanjut "
"tentang model `.*-qiskit`, lihat [Qiskit Code Assistant: Training LLMs for "
"generating Quantum Computing Code](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.19495).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Our LLMs specialized for Qiskit are available also as open-source models. "
"Check all the models available at https://huggingface.co/Qiskit.\n"
msgstr ""
"LLM khusus kami untuk Qiskit juga tersedia sebagai model sumber terbuka. "
"Semak semua model yang tersedia di https://huggingface.co/Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit HumanEval and Qiskit HumanEval Hard benchmarks {#the-qiskit-"
"humaneval-and-qiskit-humaneval-hard-benchmarks}"
msgstr ""
"Penanda aras Qiskit HumanEval dan Qiskit HumanEval Hard {#the-qiskit-"
"humaneval-and-qiskit-humaneval-hard-benchmarks}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To test the `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` and other models, we collaborated"
" with Qiskit Advocates and experts to create the execution-based benchmarks "
"called Qiskit HumanEval (QHE) and Qiskit HumanEval Hard (QHE Hard), and ran "
"them on the models. These benchmarks are similar to "
"[HumanEval](https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.03374), including multiple "
"challenging code problems to solve, all based on the official Qiskit "
"libraries.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk menguji `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` dan model-model lain, kami "
"bekerjasama dengan Qiskit Advocates dan pakar untuk mencipta penanda aras "
"berasaskan pelaksanaan yang dipanggil Qiskit HumanEval (QHE) dan Qiskit "
"HumanEval Hard (QHE Hard), dan menjalankannya pada model-model tersebut. "
"Penanda aras ini serupa dengan "
"[HumanEval](https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.03374), termasuk pelbagai masalah kod"
" yang mencabar untuk diselesaikan, semuanya berdasarkan pustaka Qiskit "
"rasmi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The benchmarks are composed of approximately 150 tests, each one made from a"
" function definition, followed by a docstring that details the task the "
"model is required to solve. Each example also includes a reference canonical"
" solution, as well as unit tests, to evaluate the correctness of the "
"generated solutions. There are three levels of difficulty for tests: basic, "
"intermediate, and difficult. The Qiskit HumanEval Hard benchmark is a "
"variation of the Qiskit HumanEval one, but removes information related to "
"code imports, so the LLM needs to figure out the right method or class "
"imports. This change makes the dataset much more challenging for LLMs, "
"according to our tests and initial results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Penanda aras ini terdiri daripada kira-kira 150 ujian, setiap satu dibuat "
"dari definisi fungsi, diikuti oleh docstring yang memperincikan tugas yang "
"diperlukan model untuk diselesaikan. Setiap contoh juga termasuk "
"penyelesaian kanonik rujukan, serta ujian unit, untuk menilai ketepatan "
"penyelesaian yang dihasilkan. Terdapat tiga tahap kesukaran untuk ujian: "
"asas, pertengahan, dan sukar. Penanda aras Qiskit HumanEval Hard ialah "
"variasi penanda aras Qiskit HumanEval, tetapi mengeluarkan maklumat "
"berkaitan import kod, supaya LLM perlu mengetahui import kaedah atau kelas "
"yang betul. Perubahan ini menjadikan set data jauh lebih mencabar bagi LLM, "
"menurut ujian dan keputusan awal kami.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The datasets for Qiskit HumanEval and Qiskit HumanEval Hard are available at"
" these websites: [Qiskit "
"HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval) and "
"[Qiskit "
"HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval_hard). "
"You can contribute to the development of these benchmarks at the [GitHub "
"repository](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-human-eval).\n"
msgstr ""
"Set data untuk Qiskit HumanEval dan Qiskit HumanEval Hard tersedia di laman "
"web ini: [Qiskit "
"HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval) dan "
"[Qiskit "
"HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval_hard). "
"Anda boleh menyumbang kepada pembangunan penanda aras ini di [repositori "
"GitHub](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-human-eval).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"install\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"install\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Qiskit Code Assistant {#install-qiskit-code-assistant}"
msgstr "Pasang Qiskit Code Assistant {#install-qiskit-code-assistant}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Learn how to install, configure, and use any of Qiskit Code Assistant models"
" on your local machine.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pelajari cara memasang, mengkonfigurasi, dan menggunakan mana-mana model "
"Qiskit Code Assistant pada mesin tempatan anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Download from the Hugging Face website\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Muat turun dari laman web Hugging Face\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow these steps to download any Qiskit Code Assistant-related model from "
"the Hugging Face website:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ikuti langkah-langkah ini untuk memuat turun mana-mana model berkaitan "
"Qiskit Code Assistant dari laman web Hugging Face:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate to the desired Qiskit model page on Hugging Face.\n"
msgstr "Navigasi ke halaman model Qiskit yang dikehendaki di Hugging Face.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go to the **Files and Versions** tab and download the safetensors or GGUF "
"model files.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pergi ke tab **Files and Versions** dan muat turun fail model safetensors "
"atau GGUF.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</AccordionItem>\n"
msgstr "</AccordionItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<AccordionItem title=\"Download using the Hugging Face CLI\">\n"
msgstr "<AccordionItem title=\"Muat turun menggunakan Hugging Face CLI\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To download any of the available Qiskit Code Assistant models using the "
"Hugging Face CLI, follow these steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk memuat turun mana-mana model Qiskit Code Assistant yang tersedia "
"menggunakan Hugging Face CLI, ikuti langkah-langkah ini:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the [Hugging Face "
"CLI](https://huggingface.co/docs/huggingface_hub/main/en/guides/cli)\n"
msgstr ""
"Pasang [Hugging Face "
"CLI](https://huggingface.co/docs/huggingface_hub/main/en/guides/cli)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Log in to your Hugging Face account\n"
msgstr "Log masuk ke akaun Hugging Face anda\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli login\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli login\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Download the model you prefer from the previous list\n"
msgstr "Muat turun model yang anda suka dari senarai sebelumnya\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli download <HF REPO NAME> <MODEL PATH> --local-dir <LOCAL PATH>\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli download <HF REPO NAME> <MODEL PATH> --local-dir <LOCAL PATH>\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Manually deploy the Qiskit Code Assistant models in "
"local through Ollama\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Gunakan model Qiskit Code Assistant secara tempatan "
"melalui Ollama secara manual\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There are multiple ways to deploy and interact with the downloaded Qiskit "
"Code Assistant model. This guide demonstrates using "
"[Ollama](https://ollama.com) as follows: either with the [Ollama "
"application](#using-the-ollama-application) by using the Hugging Face Hub "
"integration or local model, or with the [`llama-cpp-python` package](#use-"
"llama-cpp-python).\n"
msgstr ""
"Terdapat pelbagai cara untuk menggunakan dan berinteraksi dengan model "
"Qiskit Code Assistant yang dimuat turun. Panduan ini menunjukkan penggunaan "
"[Ollama](https://ollama.com) seperti berikut: sama ada dengan [aplikasi "
"Ollama](#using-the-ollama-application) menggunakan integrasi Hugging Face "
"Hub atau model tempatan, atau dengan [pakej `llama-cpp-python`](#use-llama-"
"cpp-python).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Using the Ollama application {#using-the-ollama-application}"
msgstr "Menggunakan aplikasi Ollama {#using-the-ollama-application}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Ollama application provides a simple solution to run the LLMs locally. "
"It is easy to use, with a CLI that makes the whole setup process, model "
"management, and interaction fairly straightforward. It’s ideal for quick "
"experimentation and for users that want fewer technical details to handle.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aplikasi Ollama menyediakan penyelesaian mudah untuk menjalankan LLM secara "
"tempatan. Ia mudah digunakan, dengan CLI yang menjadikan keseluruhan proses "
"persediaan, pengurusan model, dan interaksi agak mudah. Ia sesuai untuk "
"eksperimen pantas dan untuk pengguna yang mahu mengendalikan butiran "
"teknikal yang lebih sedikit.\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Ollama {#install-ollama}"
msgstr "Pasang Ollama {#install-ollama}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Download the [Ollama application](https://ollama.com/download)\n"
msgstr "Muat turun [aplikasi Ollama](https://ollama.com/download)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install the downloaded file\n"
msgstr "Pasang fail yang dimuat turun\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Launch the installed Ollama application\n"
msgstr "Lancarkan aplikasi Ollama yang dipasang\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"info\">\n"
"        The application is running successfully when the Ollama icon appears in the desktop menu bar. You can also verify the service is running by going to `http://localhost:11434/`.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"info\">\n"
"        Aplikasi berjalan dengan jayanya apabila ikon Ollama muncul dalam bar menu desktop. Anda juga boleh mengesahkan perkhidmatan sedang berjalan dengan pergi ke `http://localhost:11434/`.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Try Ollama in your terminal and start running models. For example:\n"
msgstr ""
"Cuba Ollama dalam terminal anda dan mula menjalankan model. Sebagai "
"contoh:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama run hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama run hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up Ollama using the Hugging Face Hub integration {#set-up-ollama-using-"
"the-hugging-face-hub-integration}"
msgstr ""
"Sediakan Ollama menggunakan integrasi Hugging Face Hub {#set-up-ollama-"
"using-the-hugging-face-hub-integration}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [Ollama/Hugging Face Hub "
"integration](https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/ollama) provides a way to "
"interact with models hosted on the Hugging Face Hub without needing to "
"create a new modelfile nor manually downloading the GGUF or safetensors "
"files. The default `template` and `params` files are already included for "
"the model on the Hugging Face Hub.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Integrasi Ollama/Hugging Face Hub](https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/ollama) "
"menyediakan cara untuk berinteraksi dengan model yang dihoskan di Hugging "
"Face Hub tanpa perlu mencipta modelfile baharu atau memuat turun fail GGUF "
"atau safetensors secara manual. Fail `template` dan `params` lalai sudah "
"disertakan untuk model di Hugging Face Hub.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure the Ollama application is running.\n"
msgstr "Pastikan aplikasi Ollama sedang berjalan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go the desired model page, and copy the URL. For example, "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pergi ke halaman model yang dikehendaki, dan salin URL. Sebagai contoh, "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "From your terminal, run the command:\n"
msgstr "Dari terminal anda, jalankan arahan:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use the `hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` model or any of the "
"other currently recommended GGUF official models `hf.co/Qiskit/mistral-"
"small-3.2-24b-qiskit-GGUF` or `hf.co/Qiskit/granite-3.3-8b-qiskit-GGUF`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh menggunakan model `hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` atau "
"mana-mana model GGUF rasmi yang disyorkan masa kini `hf.co/Qiskit/mistral-"
"small-3.2-24b-qiskit-GGUF` atau `hf.co/Qiskit/granite-3.3-8b-qiskit-GGUF`.\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up Ollama with a manually downloaded Qiskit Code Assistant GGUF model "
"{#set-up-ollama-with-a-manually-downloaded-qiskit-code-assistant-gguf-model}"
msgstr ""
"Sediakan Ollama dengan model GGUF Qiskit Code Assistant yang dimuat turun "
"secara manual {#set-up-ollama-with-a-manually-downloaded-qiskit-code-"
"assistant-gguf-model}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have manually downloaded a GGUF model such as "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF and you want to "
"experiment with different templates and parameters, you can follow these "
"steps to load it into your local Ollama application.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda telah memuat turun model GGUF secara manual seperti "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF dan anda ingin "
"bereksperimen dengan templat dan parameter yang berbeza, anda boleh ikuti "
"langkah-langkah ini untuk memuatkannya ke dalam aplikasi Ollama tempatan "
"anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create a `Modelfile` entering the following content and be sure to update "
"`<PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>` to the actual path of your downloaded model.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cipta `Modelfile` dengan memasukkan kandungan berikut dan pastikan anda "
"mengemas kini `<PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>` kepada laluan sebenar model yang anda "
"muat turun.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    FROM <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"
"    TEMPLATE \"\"\"{{ if .System }}\n"
"    System:\n"
"    {{ .System }}\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    FROM <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"
"    TEMPLATE \"\"\"{{ if .System }}\n"
"    System:\n"
"    {{ .System }}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    {{ end }}{{ if .Prompt }}Question:\n"
"    {{ .Prompt }}\n"
msgstr ""
"    {{ end }}{{ if .Prompt }}Question:\n"
"    {{ .Prompt }}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    {{ end }}Answer:\n"
"    ```\n"
"    \"\"\"\n"
msgstr ""
"    {{ end }}Answer:\n"
"    ```\n"
"    \"\"\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    PARAMETER stop \"Question:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"Answer:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"System:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"```\"\n"
msgstr ""
"    PARAMETER stop \"Question:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"Answer:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"System:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"```\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    PARAMETER temperature 0\n"
"    PARAMETER top_k 1\n"
msgstr ""
"    PARAMETER temperature 0\n"
"    PARAMETER top_k 1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "    ```\n"
msgstr "    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run the following command to create a custom model instance based on the "
"`Modelfile`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jalankan arahan berikut untuk mencipta instans model tersuai berdasarkan "
"`Modelfile`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama create Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit -f ./path-to-model-file\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama create Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit -f ./path-to-model-file\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"        This process may take some time for Ollama to read the model file, initialize the model instance, and configure it according to the specifications provided.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"        Proses ini mungkin mengambil sedikit masa untuk Ollama membaca fail model, memulakan instans model, dan mengkonfigurasinya mengikut spesifikasi yang diberikan.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run the Qiskit Code Assistant model manually downloaded in Ollama"
msgstr ""
"Jalankan model Qiskit Code Assistant yang dimuat turun secara manual dalam "
"Ollama"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After the `Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` model has been set up in Ollama, run "
"the following command to launch the model and interact with it in the "
"terminal (in chat mode).\n"
msgstr ""
"Selepas model `Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` telah ditetapkan dalam Ollama, "
"jalankan arahan berikut untuk melancarkan model dan berinteraksi dengannya "
"dalam terminal (dalam mod sembang).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "from llama_cpp import Llama\n"
msgstr "from llama_cpp import Llama\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "model_path = <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"
msgstr "model_path = <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"model = Llama(\n"
"        model_path,\n"
"        seed=17,\n"
"        n_ctx=10000,\n"
"        n_gpu_layers=37, # to offload in gpu, but put 0 if all in cpu\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"model = Llama(\n"
"        model_path,\n"
"        seed=17,\n"
"        n_ctx=10000,\n"
"        n_gpu_layers=37, # to offload in gpu, but put 0 if all in cpu\n"
"    )\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"input = 'Generate a quantum circuit with 2 qubits'\n"
"raw_pred = model(input)[\"choices\"][0][\"text\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"input = 'Generate a quantum circuit with 2 qubits'\n"
"raw_pred = model(input)[“choices”][0][“text”]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"generation_kwargs = {\n"
"        \"max_tokens\": 512,\n"
"        \"echo\": False, # Echo the prompt in the output\n"
"        \"top_k\": 1\n"
"    }\n"
msgstr ""
"generation_kwargs = {\n"
"        “max_tokens”: 512,\n"
"        “echo”: False, # Echo the prompt in the output\n"
"        “top_k”: 1\n"
"    }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "raw_pred = model(input, **generation_kwargs)[\"choices\"][0][\"text\"]\n"
msgstr "raw_pred = model(input, **generation_kwargs)[“choices”][0][“text”]\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use a local model file {#use-a-local-model-file}"
msgstr "Use a local model file {#use-a-local-model-file}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "llama-cli -m my_model.gguf -cnv\n"
msgstr "llama-cli -m my_model.gguf -cnv\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Or download and run a model directly from Hugging Face {#or-download-and-"
"run-a-model-directly-from-hugging-face}"
msgstr ""
"Or download and run a model directly from Hugging Face {#or-download-and-"
"run-a-model-directly-from-hugging-face}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF -cnv\n"
msgstr "llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF -cnv\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "llama-server -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF\n"
msgstr "llama-server -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF \\\n"
"  -p \"You are a friendly assistant.\" -cnv \\\n"
"  --temp 0.7 \\\n"
"  --top-k 50 \\\n"
"  --top-p 0.95 \\\n"
"  --repeat-penalty 1.1 \\\n"
"  --seed 42\n"
msgstr ""
"llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF \\\n"
"  -p “You are a friendly assistant.” -cnv \\\n"
"  --temp 0.7 \\\n"
"  --top-k 50 \\\n"
"  --top-p 0.95 \\\n"
"  --repeat-penalty 1.1 \\\n"
"  --seed 42\n"

